"4":4,"5":4,"6":4,"7":4,"8":4,"9":5,"10":5,"11":7,"12":8,"13":9,"14":10,"15":10,"16":12,"17":13},"notes":{"ts":{"2":"<code>next</code> computes one step of the chain: the sum of the squares of the digits of <code>x</code>.","3":"<code>s</code> collects the squared digits.","4":"Peel off the last digit <code>d</code>, add its square, and drop that digit from <code>x</code>.","5":"This sum is the next value in the chain.","7":"<code>slow</code> starts at <code>n</code> and <code>fast</code> one step ahead, so they differ at the start.","8":"Run until <code>fast</code> reaches 1 or catches <code>slow</code> inside a loop.","9":"<code>slow</code> moves one step along the chain.","10":"<code>fast</code> moves two steps, gaining one step on <code>slow</code> each round.","12":"Reaching 1 means the chain ends at 1; meeting anywhere else means a loop without 1."},"py":{"3":"<code>nxt</code> computes one step of the chain: the sum of the squares of the digits of <code>x</code>.","4":"<code>s</code> collects the squared digits.","5":"Repeat while <code>x</code> still has digits left.","6":"Split off the last digit <code>d</code> and keep the remaining digits in <code>x</code>.","7":"Add the square of that digit.","8":"This sum is the next value in the chain.","9":"<code>slow</code> starts at <code>n</code> and <code>fast</code> one step ahead, so they differ at the start.","10":"Run until <code>fast</code> reaches 1 or catches <code>slow</code> inside a loop.","11":"<code>slow</code> moves one step along the chain.","12":"<code>fast</code> moves two steps, gaining one step on <code>slow</code> each round.","13":"Reaching 1 means the chain ends at 1; meeting anywhere else means a loop without 1."}}}],"expected":true}